"His usage dips a little from 19.5% because VanVleet takes over the ball. Shots stay at about 12.5 per game, as in the base.","sources":["https://youtu.be/aLP080hxizA?t=552","stats"]},{"field":"mpg","text":"Udoka plays his starters heavy minutes. I trim him slightly from last season's 37.4 because the guard group is deeper.","sources":["https://youtu.be/aLP080hxizA?t=146","stats"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}